          }
        },
        "feature_row_TTeagK": {
          "type": "feature_row",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "primary",
            "align_center": false,
            "extra_padding_desktop": 20,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/10_000_Puff_Capacity_cm.webp",
            "title_1": "10,000 Puff Capacity",
            "text_1": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods provide up to 10,000 puffs under laboratory testing conditions. These pods combine a 2ml pod chamber with a 10ml refill chamber to reach 12ml total e-liquid capacity. The prefilled pods reduce frequent pod replacement compared with lower-capacity disposable devices.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_1": false,
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/12_e-liquid_capacity-cm.webp",
            "title_2": "2ml + 10ml E-Liquid Capacity",
            "text_2": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods include a 2ml prefilled pod supported by a 10ml refill container.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_2": true,
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/20mg_Nicotine_Salt_Strength_a15b246a-39b1-4ea6-a2af-2cd9a38aadf1.webp",
            "title_3": "20mg Nicotine Salt Strength",
            "text_3": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods contain 20mg/ml nicotine salt, which equals 2% strength under UK TPD regulations. These support mouth-to-lung inhalation with a controlled throat hit. They maintain consistent nicotine delivery across the full pod lifespan.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_3": false,
            "image_4": "shopify://shop_images/0.8_Mesh_Coil_Heating_cm.webp",
            "title_4": "0.8Ω Mesh Coil Heating",
            "text_4": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods include an integrated 0.8Ω mesh coil. These pods distribute heat evenly across the e-liquid surface. These pods produce stable vapour output and maintain flavour consistency across extended puff cycles.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_4": true,
            "image_5": "shopify://shop_images/Mouth-to-Lung_Inhalation_Styl.webp",
            "title_5": "Mouth-to-Lung Inhalation Style",
            "text_5": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods are designed for mouth-to-lung vaping. The airflow resistance mirrors a cigarette-style inhale, delivering controlled and steady vapour output.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_5": false,
            "image_6": "shopify://shop_images/Draw-Activated_Operation-cp.webp",
            "title_6": "Draw-Activated Operation",
            "text_6": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods activate automatically during inhalation. The design removes the need for buttons or manual settings.<br/><br/></p>",
            "reverse_6": true
          }
        },
        "flavours_section_nAimdF": {
          "type": "flavours_section",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "primary",
            "align_center": true,
            "title": "Available Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods Flavours",
            "intro": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods are available across fruit, ice, candy, citrus, and soda-inspired profiles. Each flavour is sealed within the prefilled pod structure and delivers consistent vapour performance across the full puff capacity.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Available_Flavours_123eda3e-421f-4d1c-ba32-fc6978e1f262.webp",
            "card_list": "<p>Blue Razz| Tart blue raspberry meets juicy cherry for a bold, berry-forward vape with balanced sweetness. This duo brings tangy and fruity notes together with a smooth finish.<br/></p><p>CP Special / Rainbow Skittz|  A multi-fruit candy blend that bursts with sugary sweetness reminiscent of rainbow sweets. Its vibrant and fun taste makes each puff feel like a flavor party in your mouth.</p><p>Blueberry Raspberry| A classic berry blend where ripe blueberries and raspberries mingle for a rich, juicy sweetness. The flavor stays smooth and balanced, perfect for fruit lovers.<br/></p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p><p>Cherry Ice|Sweet cherry with a cool finish</p>",
