        "steps_group_eNyRMp": {
          "type": "steps_group",
          "settings": {
            "tab": "primary",
            "align_center": false,
            "heading_1": "How to Use Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods",
            "intro_1": "<p>Using Crystal Pro CP 10K Prefilled Pods is simple and designed for a quick, beginner-friendly setup. The sealed 2ml pod and integrated 10ml refill chamber work together through an internal liquid transfer system, making installation clean and simple.</p>",
            "steps_1": "<p>Remove All Packaging and Seals| Open the pod packaging and remove the protective stickers, silicone plugs, and mouthpiece seals. Ensuring all seals are removed allows proper airflow and correct device activation.<br/>Insert the Prefilled Pod | Align the Crystal Pro CP10000 pod with the top of the device and push it in firmly until it fits securely. The pod connects to the internal liquid feed system automatically.<br/><br/>Allow the Coil to Saturate | After inserting a new pod, leave the device upright for 5–10 minutes before first use. This allows the 0.8Ω mesh coil to fully absorb e-liquid and helps prevent a burnt taste during initial puffs.</p><p>Check Battery Level | Ensure the Crystal Pro CP10000 device has sufficient charge. If needed, connect a USB-C cable to recharge. Monitor battery status using the LED battery indicator on the device.<br/>Inhale to Activate | The Crystal Pro CP10000 operates using a draw-activated system. Simply inhale through the mouthpiece to begin vaping. No buttons or manual settings are required.</p><p><strong>Replace When Empty | </strong>When flavour becomes weak, vapour output drops, or a burnt taste appears, remove the used pod and insert a new Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pod to continue vaping.</p>",
            "steps_1_note": "",
            "usage_step_text_bg": false,
            "usage_step_text_bg_color": "#f4faf8",
            "heading_2": "When to Replace Crystal Pro CP 10k pods?",
            "intro_2": "<p>Crystal Pro CP 10k pods should be replaced once the following signs appear:</p>",
            "steps_2": "<p>Flavour Becomes Muted | The flavour may start to weaken and lose its intensity over time. Fruit, sweet, or icy notes may not taste as strong as before, indicating that the pod is nearing the end of its lifespan.</p><p>Burnt or Dry Taste | A dry or slightly burnt taste can develop during use. This usually means the mesh coil has reached the end of its usable life.<br/><br/></p><p>Reduced Vapour Output | Vapour production may become lighter and less dense than usual. Even if the device activates properly, the overall performance can feel reduced.<br/><br/>Empty E-Liquid Supply | Once the full e-liquid system has been used, both flavour and vapour output decline. This confirms the refill pod system needs replacement.<br/><br/><strong>Harsh Throat Sensation | </strong>Inhalation may begin to feel rough or harsher than normal, even at the same nicotine strength. This suggests the pod condition has deteriorated, and replacement is required.<br/><br/></p>",
            "extra_padding_desktop": 30
          }
        },
        "faq_list_RFW3Jh": {
          "type": "faq_list",
          "settings": {
