            "extra_padding_desktop": 0,
            "question_1": "How many puffs do Crystal Pro CP 10K pods provide?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods are rated for up to 10,000 puffs under laboratory testing conditions, depending on usage style and draw length.</p>",
            "question_2": "What is the total e-liquid capacity?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods combine a 2ml pod chamber with a 10ml internal refill chamber.<br/><br/></p>",
            "question_3": "What nicotine strength do these pods contain?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods contain 20mg/ml nicotine salt (2%), compliant with UK TPD regulations and suitable for mouth-to-lung vaping.<br/><br/></p>",
            "question_4": "Are Crystal Pro CP 10K pods refillable?",
            "answer_4": "<p>No, Crystal Pro CP10000 Pods are sealed and prefilled. They are designed for replacement once the e-liquid is depleted.<br/><br/></p>",
            "question_5": "Which device are these pods compatible with?",
            "answer_5": "<p>Crystal Pro CP10000 Prefilled Pods are compatible exclusively with the Crystal Pro CP10000 device and will not function with other Crystal models.<br/><br/></p>",
            "question_6": "What coil is built into the pods?",
